		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Three gigantic skulls atop a creaking, flesh-trunk with thick, vine-like tendril-legs. Feeds on self-loathing.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 63, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +8 (2d8 + <strong>C</strong>HA bleed) or eternal fear, <strong>MV</strong> double near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>CHA Bleed</strong>. 1d4 CHA damage each round. CON 12+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch. Catatonic terror at 0 CHA.</p><p></p><p><strong>Eternal Fear</strong>. All mortals who behold sahkil within far, CHA 15+ or terrified. Only curable via restoration or wish.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
